    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "already checked the fluid levels and color, looks fine. no obvious aeration or burnt smell. i'm leaning towards a solenoid issue or maybe something in the valve body. what kind of specific tests can i run with the scanner to confirm if a solenoid is actually sticking or if it's a physical blockage in the line?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
